1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:02,600
ALL DEPICTED EVENTS ARE FICTIONAL

2
00:00:02,680 --> 00:00:06,360
AND FOR ENTERTAINMENT PURPOSES ONLY.
VIEWER DISCRETION IS ADVISED.

3
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:23,240
That's it.
That's what the fortune teller said.

4
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:25,040
<i>This refers to the incident at the hut?</i>

5
00:00:25,120 --> 00:00:28,480
<i>Do I enter the woods by the temple</i>
<i>to find the hut?</i>

6
00:00:35,080 --> 00:00:37,680
You came here alone, did you not?

7
00:00:37,760 --> 00:00:39,280
<i>Ma Krathuep Rong.</i>

8
00:00:39,840 --> 00:00:41,760
Very well.

9
00:00:41,840 --> 00:00:42,960
Enjoy yourself.

10
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:47,040
Have a look!

11
00:00:47,120 --> 00:00:48,000
Have a look!

12
00:00:48,640 --> 00:00:49,800
Take a good look!

13
00:00:52,040 --> 00:00:53,680
He wanted me dead!

14
00:00:59,720 --> 00:01:01,760
That lord must harbor
deep resentment towards me.

15
00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:07,560
It is not about
some dalliance between him and Klao.

16
00:01:07,640 --> 00:01:08,560
He knows the truth!

17
00:01:08,640 --> 00:01:10,000
Yes, he certainly does.

18
00:01:13,720 --> 00:01:14,600
You.

19
00:01:20,800 --> 00:01:22,600
Do not lay a hand on me!

20
00:01:23,840 --> 00:01:25,280
Calm yourself, Cherd.

21
00:01:26,840 --> 00:01:28,400
If that were the case,

22
00:01:29,640 --> 00:01:31,600
he would never have let you go.

23
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:34,000
Klao…

24
00:01:35,400 --> 00:01:39,960
He must be piecing together
what happened to him in the past.

25
00:01:40,800 --> 00:01:42,880
So long as he cannot recall the truth,

26
00:01:43,960 --> 00:01:47,720
I believe… you need not involve yourself.

27
00:01:52,760 --> 00:01:55,280
Why wait until his memory returns?

28
00:01:57,840 --> 00:01:59,800
<i>Better to pluck the thorn out now.</i>

29
00:01:59,880 --> 00:02:00,720
<i>End it.</i>

30
00:03:40,960 --> 00:03:42,560
God! God! God! God!

31
00:03:45,640 --> 00:03:46,520
Gosh!

32
00:03:46,600 --> 00:03:47,560
That scared me!

33
00:03:49,160 --> 00:03:51,560
Why does Klao's mission
have to be this hard?

34
00:03:52,640 --> 00:03:54,880
I think by the time I complete it,

35
00:03:54,960 --> 00:03:56,680
I'll probably die of a heart attack!

36
00:03:57,640 --> 00:03:58,560
Do not die yet.

37
00:03:59,920 --> 00:04:00,880
Mommy! Mommy!

38
00:04:01,680 --> 00:04:02,520
Mommy!

39
00:04:08,040 --> 00:04:08,920
Fortune teller?

40
00:04:11,120 --> 00:04:12,120
How did you get here?

41
00:04:12,200 --> 00:04:13,680
On foot.

42
00:04:13,760 --> 00:04:15,800
I am foraging in the forest for a ritual.

43
00:04:18,200 --> 00:04:19,320
What is it?

44
00:04:23,240 --> 00:04:25,640
Come. It is not yet
your time to die again.

45
00:04:25,720 --> 00:04:26,800
Follow me.

46
00:04:31,800 --> 00:04:33,280
Fortune teller, wait up!

47
00:05:13,200 --> 00:05:15,440
What brings you to these woods
at such an hour?

48
00:05:17,840 --> 00:05:19,000
What is it you seek?

49
00:05:21,400 --> 00:05:23,120
Is it a pond you are after?

50
00:05:26,800 --> 00:05:27,880
Yes.

51
00:05:28,600 --> 00:05:30,560
It was mentioned in Klao's notes.

52
00:05:31,560 --> 00:05:35,320
It specified the time
and place for a rendezvous.

53
00:05:35,400 --> 00:05:37,520
It was a hut by a pond…

54
00:05:38,440 --> 00:05:40,480
accessed through a temple entrance.

55
00:05:46,960 --> 00:05:49,240
I believe that
if I complete the mission,

56
00:05:49,320 --> 00:05:51,320
I'll get to return to the future.

57
00:05:55,640 --> 00:05:56,960
The future, you say?

58
00:05:59,880 --> 00:06:00,720
Yes.

59
00:06:01,480 --> 00:06:03,320
It's 400 years from now.

60
00:06:04,880 --> 00:06:07,200
I've traveled back in time.

61
00:06:09,080 --> 00:06:11,200
There's also a version of you
in the future.

62
00:06:11,760 --> 00:06:13,920
Her name is Rattikarn,

63
00:06:15,080 --> 00:06:17,280
one of the best fortune tellers
in the country.

64
00:06:17,800 --> 00:06:18,680
No.

65
00:06:20,560 --> 00:06:22,080
You did not go on a voyage.

66
00:06:22,840 --> 00:06:25,720
You are still Klao.
You have not gone anywhere.

67
00:06:26,880 --> 00:06:28,800
Again, Fortune teller?

68
00:06:28,880 --> 00:06:31,640
I told you I've traveled through time.

69
00:06:31,720 --> 00:06:33,000
My name is Nakun.

70
00:06:33,080 --> 00:06:34,800
-It's not--
-You two are the same.

71
00:06:37,040 --> 00:06:39,080
You are retracing every step of his life.

72
00:06:40,560 --> 00:06:42,120
<i>We both like writing.</i>

73
00:06:42,200 --> 00:06:44,720
<i>I made my way to the market Klao visited.</i>

74
00:06:44,800 --> 00:06:45,840
<i>I got to meet Pim,</i>

75
00:06:45,920 --> 00:06:47,120
<i>Cherd,</i>

76
00:06:47,200 --> 00:06:48,600
<i>and everyone connected to Klao.</i>

77
00:06:48,680 --> 00:06:50,800
-Dear Klao.
-Where have you been?

78
00:06:50,880 --> 00:06:52,680
<i>I'm touched by Klao's past…</i>

79
00:06:52,760 --> 00:06:54,400
-Father!
<i>-…as if it happened to me.</i>

80
00:06:54,480 --> 00:06:55,320
Father!

81
00:07:10,520 --> 00:07:14,200
Water may be poured from this bowl
to another,

82
00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:20,000
but its essence still flows
from the old one.

83
00:07:29,080 --> 00:07:30,960
Wrong place and wrong time.

84
00:07:31,600 --> 00:07:34,360
You chose to return here,
as you wished.

85
00:07:56,840 --> 00:07:58,240
<i>I…</i>

86
00:07:58,320 --> 00:07:59,720
<i>pray…</i>

87
00:08:00,840 --> 00:08:03,360
<i>to all the sacred beings of this world.</i>

88
00:08:04,960 --> 00:08:06,720
<i>May I be granted</i>

89
00:08:06,800 --> 00:08:10,800
<i>the chance to return</i>
<i>and set things right.</i>

90
00:08:11,720 --> 00:08:13,920
<i>I solemnly swear to the heavens…</i>

91
00:08:15,360 --> 00:08:18,400
<i>I shall cleanse the stain</i>
<i>upon my family's name</i>

92
00:08:18,480 --> 00:08:21,200
<i>and protect those I love at all costs.</i>

93
00:08:31,440 --> 00:08:36,440
<i>The knot must be untied</i>
<i>by the very hand that bound it.</i>

94
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:38,880
<i>You have made your solemn prayer.</i>

95
00:08:38,960 --> 00:08:41,360
<i>Thus, you must return to fulfill it.</i>

96
00:08:43,200 --> 00:08:45,400
Pray with all your heart,

97
00:08:46,840 --> 00:08:48,640
and your prayers shall be answered.

98
00:08:48,720 --> 00:08:49,880
Indeed.

99
00:08:51,120 --> 00:08:52,520
If you wish to return,

100
00:08:52,600 --> 00:08:55,840
simply make a wish with the stone
by sheer force of will.

101
00:09:01,480 --> 00:09:02,800
I'm afraid it's impossible.

102
00:09:04,880 --> 00:09:07,240
-I gave it to Kaew.
-Good heavens!

103
00:09:08,560 --> 00:09:11,920
If he makes his prayer before you,
the stone will become useless.

104
00:09:13,320 --> 00:09:14,680
Make a wish, Kaew.

105
00:09:15,520 --> 00:09:17,800
This is but a rock.

106
00:09:18,360 --> 00:09:20,640
There's no harm in trying, is there?

107
00:09:20,720 --> 00:09:22,880
Kaew was so furious with me
that he cursed me,

108
00:09:22,960 --> 00:09:25,280
vowing never to look upon me
for all lifetimes.

109
00:09:26,840 --> 00:09:27,960
In the present time…

110
00:09:28,920 --> 00:09:31,200
No, in the next life,

111
00:09:32,960 --> 00:09:34,920
the reason Pun is being so cold to Thee…

112
00:09:36,640 --> 00:09:38,400
is because of this very stone.

113
00:09:39,920 --> 00:09:41,320
Leave! Be gone!

114
00:09:41,400 --> 00:09:42,920
Set wrongs aright!

115
00:09:43,000 --> 00:09:44,600
Wait, fortune teller! No!

116
00:09:44,680 --> 00:09:45,640
Fortune teller!

117
00:09:55,360 --> 00:09:56,200
Phop.

118
00:09:57,760 --> 00:09:59,880
How did I end up here?

119
00:10:12,840 --> 00:10:15,080
You wandered into the forest
in your sleep.

120
00:10:16,040 --> 00:10:18,160
A servant found you at the break of dawn.

121
00:10:19,120 --> 00:10:20,680
So I carried you back to safety.

122
00:10:27,920 --> 00:10:30,720
When you found me,

123
00:10:30,800 --> 00:10:32,200
was I soaked?

124
00:10:36,240 --> 00:10:37,240
Soaked?

125
00:10:40,440 --> 00:10:41,720
Not at all.

126
00:10:43,880 --> 00:10:45,360
<i>So, what I saw was a dream?</i>

127
00:10:46,280 --> 00:10:47,680
<i>But it felt so real.</i>

128
00:10:48,520 --> 00:10:50,200
<i>If I really have been reincarnated,</i>

129
00:10:51,040 --> 00:10:54,320
<i>this means that Klao and I</i>
<i>are the same person.</i>

130
00:11:07,120 --> 00:11:08,520
Are you not…

131
00:11:09,760 --> 00:11:11,000
upset with me…

132
00:11:12,760 --> 00:11:15,760
about what I told you at the rice field?

133
00:11:17,520 --> 00:11:19,280
How could I?

134
00:11:20,600 --> 00:11:22,800
Simply knowing
that you love me delights me.

135
00:11:24,560 --> 00:11:27,320
Whether you wish for me to be your brother

136
00:11:27,400 --> 00:11:28,880
or anything else,

137
00:11:30,200 --> 00:11:33,040
it is your presence in my life
that matters most.

138
00:11:47,600 --> 00:11:51,400
I must change my attire
and set out on patrol now.

139
00:11:52,040 --> 00:11:53,640
You should go and bathe now.

140
00:11:56,600 --> 00:11:57,440
Phop.

141
00:12:01,680 --> 00:12:02,520
I…

142
00:12:03,760 --> 00:12:05,160
I am very worried about Kaew.

143
00:12:07,240 --> 00:12:09,960
Please allow me to see him.

144
00:12:14,720 --> 00:12:15,560
Go on.

145
00:12:17,880 --> 00:12:19,400
You need not ask me.

146
00:12:21,200 --> 00:12:23,200
From now on, wherever you choose to go,

147
00:12:24,280 --> 00:12:26,440
I shall never forbid you again.

148
00:12:37,560 --> 00:12:41,000
<i>Let him go and complete the mission.</i>

149
00:12:42,960 --> 00:12:45,520
<i>Let him go get married and start a family.</i>

150
00:12:59,840 --> 00:13:02,600
Are you sure
you will never speak to Jom again?

151
00:13:10,240 --> 00:13:11,280
I have heard that…

152
00:13:12,280 --> 00:13:14,200
you cursed him, is that not so?

153
00:13:22,280 --> 00:13:23,200
Kaew.

154
00:13:23,280 --> 00:13:27,440
Your curse might come true.

155
00:13:32,920 --> 00:13:33,840
A blessing then.

156
00:13:35,720 --> 00:13:37,240
At last, he will feel.

157
00:13:40,320 --> 00:13:41,800
Is it truly a blessing?

158
00:13:41,880 --> 00:13:43,760
Do you truly wish it to come true,

159
00:13:45,640 --> 00:13:48,720
or are you merely being spiteful?

160
00:13:50,800 --> 00:13:54,600
Last night, the Physician stayed
and watched over you all night long.

161
00:13:55,760 --> 00:13:57,480
You spent the entire night weeping.

162
00:14:07,760 --> 00:14:09,240
I have already driven him away,

163
00:14:10,160 --> 00:14:12,000
and I have already grieved as well.

164
00:14:16,840 --> 00:14:19,080
I have decided to
seek my father's permission

165
00:14:19,160 --> 00:14:21,480
to live with my relatives in Pak Nam Pho.

166
00:14:22,960 --> 00:14:25,480
We cannot go back
and alter the past, Klao.

167
00:14:38,080 --> 00:14:39,040
Kaew.

168
00:14:39,920 --> 00:14:42,080
Cease this spitefulness.

169
00:14:43,640 --> 00:14:45,160
Your curse…

170
00:14:46,240 --> 00:14:48,400
may or may not come true in the next life,

171
00:14:49,880 --> 00:14:54,280
but at least there remains a chance
to be together now.

172
00:14:57,200 --> 00:14:59,360
Go and reconcile with Jom.

173
00:15:03,560 --> 00:15:06,000
Take my words and reflect upon them well.

174
00:15:17,440 --> 00:15:18,680
Chuay, let us go.

175
00:15:30,920 --> 00:15:32,640
Do you think the same as I do?

176
00:15:32,720 --> 00:15:33,560
I do.

177
00:15:34,360 --> 00:15:36,320
You must speak with the physician.

178
00:15:36,400 --> 00:15:37,360
Not about that!

179
00:15:39,280 --> 00:15:41,200
Klao speaks with such clarity and reason,

180
00:15:41,280 --> 00:15:43,480
as if he were never of unsound mind.

181
00:15:46,520 --> 00:15:47,640
As you are not ill,

182
00:15:47,720 --> 00:15:49,720
you should take your leave now, Klao.

183
00:15:50,360 --> 00:15:52,040
I wish not to speak of that matter.

184
00:15:56,880 --> 00:15:58,240
Oh, Jom!

185
00:15:58,960 --> 00:16:00,960
You spent the entire night
waiting for him.

186
00:16:01,040 --> 00:16:02,440
Put in a little more effort.

187
00:16:02,520 --> 00:16:05,280
I hear that Kaew is moving
to another city.

188
00:16:08,680 --> 00:16:11,520
So, the rumors from the servants
are true after all.

189
00:16:13,040 --> 00:16:15,800
Lo and behold,
you still do nothing despite that?

190
00:16:16,760 --> 00:16:19,560
You may claim the need
to tend to the sick,

191
00:16:19,640 --> 00:16:21,920
yet Kaew suffers
from an ailment of the heart.

192
00:16:22,520 --> 00:16:24,760
Do you have no love or concern for him?

193
00:16:27,800 --> 00:16:31,520
It is precisely because I care
that I must compel him to let go.

194
00:16:32,160 --> 00:16:33,120
It is for the best.

195
00:16:34,720 --> 00:16:35,720
Is that truly so?

196
00:16:36,840 --> 00:16:40,240
Those who love each other
must care for one another.

197
00:16:41,040 --> 00:16:44,600
Yet for two men to love one another,
it will only bring suffering.

198
00:16:45,920 --> 00:16:48,360
It seems you have
completely forgotten Roong

199
00:16:48,440 --> 00:16:50,720
and his story with
High Lord Boribanpracha.

200
00:17:02,680 --> 00:17:04,440
Hold it together, Roong.

201
00:17:04,520 --> 00:17:05,520
Roong.

202
00:17:07,200 --> 00:17:08,079
Physician.

203
00:17:08,160 --> 00:17:09,200
Physician!

204
00:17:09,760 --> 00:17:11,319
Physician!

205
00:17:11,839 --> 00:17:12,800
What has happened?

206
00:17:13,480 --> 00:17:16,079
-How has it come to this?
-Father discovered the truth.

207
00:17:17,119 --> 00:17:19,520
Thus, he was caned
until the break of dawn.

208
00:17:19,599 --> 00:17:21,440
Pray, help us, physician.

209
00:17:26,319 --> 00:17:27,720
I beg of you.

210
00:17:31,960 --> 00:17:33,160
The wounds are severe.

211
00:17:34,840 --> 00:17:37,600
I warned you never to
involve yourself with him.

212
00:17:48,920 --> 00:17:51,680
Never has anyone brought me
such happiness as you have.

213
00:17:53,640 --> 00:17:55,480
I cannot endure life without you.

214
00:17:57,480 --> 00:17:59,320
We did no wrong.

215
00:18:01,080 --> 00:18:03,440
It is Father who has gone too far.

216
00:18:10,080 --> 00:18:11,240
Roong!

217
00:18:11,320 --> 00:18:12,400
Pray, take leave.

218
00:18:12,480 --> 00:18:13,880
Unhand me at once!

219
00:18:15,000 --> 00:18:16,120
Roong!

220
00:18:29,040 --> 00:18:29,880
Son!

221
00:18:31,800 --> 00:18:32,840
Father.

222
00:18:32,920 --> 00:18:36,520
I have told you
not to help him, have I not?

223
00:18:36,600 --> 00:18:38,800
Roong lingers at death's door, Father.

224
00:18:40,600 --> 00:18:42,360
Do not harm him! Do not!

225
00:18:45,080 --> 00:18:46,240
No!

226
00:18:47,560 --> 00:18:49,120
Roong! Roong!

227
00:18:49,200 --> 00:18:51,560
Dare not address my son in such a manner!

228
00:18:56,160 --> 00:18:57,600
Take him to the manor at once!

229
00:18:59,560 --> 00:19:00,640
Confine him.

230
00:19:01,760 --> 00:19:04,000
Never let him lay eyes upon my son again!

231
00:19:09,680 --> 00:19:10,560
Release me!

232
00:19:10,640 --> 00:19:11,520
Roong!

233
00:19:14,360 --> 00:19:15,200
Roong!

234
00:19:17,240 --> 00:19:18,320
Roong!

235
00:19:31,880 --> 00:19:35,440
Yet, not until dawn did Roong pass away.

236
00:19:36,560 --> 00:19:39,240
And so, High Lord Boribanpracha
followed him in death.

237
00:19:40,640 --> 00:19:42,560
I do not wish Kaew
to suffer the same fate.

238
00:19:42,640 --> 00:19:43,680
But…

239
00:19:44,680 --> 00:19:48,920
that is likely owing to his father's
inability to accept the truth.

240
00:19:50,000 --> 00:19:54,120
However, Kaew's family
does not wish for their son to suffer.

241
00:19:55,200 --> 00:19:58,640
Furthermore, it is likely that
your parents do not mind.

242
00:19:59,640 --> 00:20:02,320
As a physician,
I must be a pillar for others

243
00:20:02,400 --> 00:20:04,560
and remain trustworthy.

244
00:20:10,280 --> 00:20:14,000
People will rely on you
for your talents and abilities,

245
00:20:14,080 --> 00:20:16,080
not on whom you fall for.

246
00:20:16,680 --> 00:20:19,160
It is not wrong at all to be who you are.

247
00:20:19,920 --> 00:20:23,240
In Ayothaya, no law condemns those
who love their own kind.

248
00:20:24,200 --> 00:20:25,640
In the future,

249
00:20:26,400 --> 00:20:28,920
Thailand shall be the first country
in Southeast Asia

250
00:20:29,960 --> 00:20:32,960
where women may love each other,
and men likewise,

251
00:20:33,040 --> 00:20:35,600
and may wed under the law's protection.

252
00:20:39,760 --> 00:20:42,160
I thought you had finally
come to your senses,

253
00:20:42,240 --> 00:20:44,440
yet you remain as deranged as ever.

254
00:20:46,600 --> 00:20:49,240
Even should the future
unfold as you have foretold,

255
00:20:50,320 --> 00:20:52,280
I shall not live long enough to see it.

256
00:20:52,360 --> 00:20:53,800
Then so be it.

257
00:20:55,560 --> 00:20:58,800
But at least, in his final moment,

258
00:20:59,720 --> 00:21:01,920
even after being caned
to the brink of death,

259
00:21:03,360 --> 00:21:05,400
Roong never thought of
leaving the High Lord.

260
00:21:07,720 --> 00:21:10,000
Why then should you abandon Kaew?

261
00:21:21,760 --> 00:21:26,960
Make haste and reconcile with him
before it is too late, Jom.

262
00:21:48,360 --> 00:21:51,760
Chuay, when will the rower arrive?

263
00:21:55,360 --> 00:21:56,200
Chuay.

264
00:22:02,240 --> 00:22:04,680
Were you moved by
the tragedy of those young men?

265
00:22:12,360 --> 00:22:13,280
Yes, indeed.

266
00:22:14,480 --> 00:22:18,080
Lovers should never be torn apart.

267
00:22:24,480 --> 00:22:27,440
What has passed
between you and the Lord, Master?

268
00:22:28,440 --> 00:22:31,200
Neither of you looked well this morning.

269
00:22:32,080 --> 00:22:34,880
Are you truly going to give up on him?

270
00:22:37,120 --> 00:22:39,120
You do not find the relationship…

271
00:22:39,200 --> 00:22:41,520
between Phop and me to be unacceptable?

272
00:22:44,480 --> 00:22:45,600
I know not, Master.

273
00:22:46,760 --> 00:22:50,400
I simply think it is better for lovers
to love than to hate.

274
00:22:51,440 --> 00:22:53,960
After you knocked
Physician Jom back to his senses,

275
00:22:54,040 --> 00:22:57,600
I found you and the Lord
to be no different.

276
00:23:01,200 --> 00:23:03,440
I do not wish history to repeat itself.

277
00:23:06,160 --> 00:23:07,480
History repeats itself?

278
00:23:15,360 --> 00:23:16,200
Chuay.

279
00:23:18,080 --> 00:23:19,920
Kindly bring me to Phop, will you?

280
00:23:23,000 --> 00:23:23,960
Yes, Master.

281
00:23:24,040 --> 00:23:26,600
The rower shall be here soon.

282
00:23:41,520 --> 00:23:43,560
Your tea is ready, Masters.

283
00:24:04,480 --> 00:24:06,280
Coming all this way to see me,

284
00:24:06,360 --> 00:24:08,640
I suspect you have
more on your mind than tea.

285
00:24:10,640 --> 00:24:11,480
Indeed.

286
00:24:12,640 --> 00:24:16,160
There is something
I wish to speak to you about.

287
00:24:27,240 --> 00:24:30,720
It concerns my previous disappearance.

288
00:24:39,560 --> 00:24:40,400
A-Chai,

289
00:24:41,400 --> 00:24:44,080
I would like the same steamed buns
as before.

290
00:24:48,560 --> 00:24:49,400
Understood.

291
00:24:56,280 --> 00:24:58,720
We had a quarrel…

292
00:24:59,960 --> 00:25:03,240
over my attempt to hunt down

293
00:25:03,320 --> 00:25:05,600
the one accusing my father.

294
00:25:05,680 --> 00:25:09,240
Whosoever is found guilty of bribery,

295
00:25:09,320 --> 00:25:11,120
such as the trafficking of opium…

296
00:25:13,000 --> 00:25:14,480
Get a hold of yourself, Klao.

297
00:25:14,560 --> 00:25:16,000
Cherd is but a commoner.

298
00:25:18,240 --> 00:25:21,320
The reason I had to
get close to Cherd was…

299
00:25:21,400 --> 00:25:23,080
You are suspicious of him?

300
00:25:24,680 --> 00:25:26,320
But I have told you not to--

301
00:25:26,400 --> 00:25:28,360
My memories have begun to return.

302
00:25:30,240 --> 00:25:32,480
Before I disappeared,

303
00:25:33,480 --> 00:25:35,240
Cherd attacked me.

304
00:25:36,560 --> 00:25:38,000
Steamed buns, Masters.

305
00:25:42,720 --> 00:25:44,040
That was rather quick.

306
00:25:47,400 --> 00:25:48,480
I would like dessert.

307
00:25:50,320 --> 00:25:53,280
Whatever you offer,
I shall gladly have it all.

308
00:25:54,280 --> 00:25:55,760
Fetch me dessert, will you?

309
00:25:59,600 --> 00:26:01,080
The sweets, if you would.

310
00:26:04,840 --> 00:26:05,760
Yes, Master.

311
00:26:15,440 --> 00:26:17,800
You must have heard the rumors

312
00:26:17,880 --> 00:26:20,400
about my visits to see Pim
at the House of Pleasure.

313
00:26:21,840 --> 00:26:23,800
I was there to gather information.

314
00:26:26,360 --> 00:26:31,360
I believed she knew something about Cherd

315
00:26:32,480 --> 00:26:36,720
and what had happened
before my disappearance.

316
00:26:40,040 --> 00:26:41,520
Here it is.

317
00:26:41,600 --> 00:26:43,000
Here.

318
00:26:43,080 --> 00:26:45,200
Master Klao and Lord Phop…

319
00:26:45,280 --> 00:26:46,640
Impeccable timing.

320
00:26:46,720 --> 00:26:48,800
I have just finished
preparing the desserts.

321
00:26:48,880 --> 00:26:52,520
It is called Lyu Da Gun,

322
00:26:52,600 --> 00:26:56,000
a beloved dessert from China.

323
00:26:56,080 --> 00:26:57,200
It is made from flour,

324
00:26:57,280 --> 00:27:01,640
soybeans, black beans,
sugar, and sweet osmanthus,

325
00:27:01,720 --> 00:27:05,640
commonly known as <i>guihua.</i>

326
00:27:05,720 --> 00:27:08,640
It comes from the city of Tianjin,

327
00:27:08,720 --> 00:27:13,120
by the Haihe River, near--

328
00:27:13,200 --> 00:27:14,080
Master.

329
00:27:15,080 --> 00:27:16,320
A-Chai.

330
00:27:16,960 --> 00:27:19,960
My thanks to you both
for your kindness,

331
00:27:20,840 --> 00:27:23,000
but pray, let us speak in private first.

332
00:27:24,280 --> 00:27:25,560
Absolutely.

333
00:27:26,680 --> 00:27:27,960
Why are you standing here?

334
00:27:28,040 --> 00:27:29,960
They have matters to discuss!

335
00:27:30,040 --> 00:27:31,120
Do not just stand there!

336
00:27:31,200 --> 00:27:34,000
My apologies for the trouble
caused by my establishment.

337
00:27:34,080 --> 00:27:35,160
Begone! Begone! Begone!

338
00:27:35,240 --> 00:27:37,240
Get back to your work!

339
00:27:37,320 --> 00:27:40,240
My apologies for the trouble
caused by my establishment.

340
00:27:40,320 --> 00:27:43,200
I too must take my leave.

341
00:27:43,840 --> 00:27:44,920
Master!

342
00:27:48,440 --> 00:27:50,960
You probably knew
that I suffer from amnesia.

343
00:27:53,080 --> 00:27:54,320
Pray, tell me,

344
00:27:55,320 --> 00:27:58,200
with whom was I…

345
00:27:59,280 --> 00:28:02,040
when I had a quarrel here?

346
00:28:02,120 --> 00:28:02,960
Was it Cherd?

347
00:28:05,560 --> 00:28:07,400
No, no.

348
00:28:08,240 --> 00:28:11,720
You were there to see a certain lady

349
00:28:11,800 --> 00:28:14,640
who was accompanied by a Chinese man.

350
00:28:17,280 --> 00:28:20,200
<i>You became intoxicated</i>
<i>after a visit to a tavern.</i>

351
00:28:20,280 --> 00:28:23,160
<i>Then you recklessly lunged at them.</i>

352
00:28:23,240 --> 00:28:24,280
<i>Pim.</i>

353
00:28:24,360 --> 00:28:26,040
<i>Why must you hide from me?</i>

354
00:28:26,640 --> 00:28:27,600
<i>I am not.</i>

355
00:28:27,680 --> 00:28:29,800
<i>I receive no more guests.</i>

356
00:28:30,520 --> 00:28:31,360
<i>If not,</i>

357
00:28:32,040 --> 00:28:34,240
<i>then tell me, why are you with this man?</i>

358
00:28:36,120 --> 00:28:37,800
<i>We must speak at once.</i>

359
00:28:39,040 --> 00:28:41,760
Keep away from my woman!

360
00:28:41,840 --> 00:28:43,560
<i>The Chinese man shouted.</i>

361
00:28:44,600 --> 00:28:45,680
<i>Master Klao!</i>

362
00:28:46,440 --> 00:28:47,720
<i>Leave this place at once!</i>

363
00:28:53,680 --> 00:28:57,960
<i>In the end, I was forced,</i>
<i>against my will, to bid you leave.</i>

364
00:29:02,200 --> 00:29:03,640
My Lord,

365
00:29:03,720 --> 00:29:06,920
I beg you, do not punish me.

366
00:29:07,720 --> 00:29:11,120
I only wished to maintain order
within my establishment.

367
00:29:11,200 --> 00:29:13,640
That is why I had no choice

368
00:29:13,720 --> 00:29:16,120
but to bid him leave.

369
00:29:16,200 --> 00:29:17,560
That is enough, Master.

370
00:29:17,640 --> 00:29:19,600
I have yet to say anything.

371
00:29:25,960 --> 00:29:27,880
I must have been too desperate…

372
00:29:30,360 --> 00:29:33,560
to learn the truth from Pim
that my emotions had taken hold of me.

373
00:29:37,440 --> 00:29:41,200
But as you can see,
she must have known something.

374
00:29:42,640 --> 00:29:44,240
If not, why avoid me?

375
00:29:47,000 --> 00:29:50,080
I must pay
the House of Pleasure another visit.

376
00:29:52,520 --> 00:29:54,480
And for what reason do you tell me this?

377
00:29:55,520 --> 00:29:57,760
Why not keep it hidden,
as you have always done?

378
00:30:00,920 --> 00:30:02,480
I have come to realize that…

379
00:30:07,880 --> 00:30:10,320
you are the one person
I trust most in my life.

380
00:30:17,160 --> 00:30:19,680
From now on,
I shall keep nothing hidden from you.

381
00:30:26,160 --> 00:30:27,160
If that is the case,

382
00:30:28,360 --> 00:30:30,320
I shall help you.

383
00:30:40,920 --> 00:30:41,760
But…

384
00:30:42,760 --> 00:30:45,120
if you must visit the House of Pleasure,

385
00:30:47,600 --> 00:30:49,280
would that not taint your honor?

386
00:31:01,960 --> 00:31:03,640
<i>Back in the woods by the temple,</i>

387
00:31:04,400 --> 00:31:06,840
<i>Cherd appeared to resent you greatly.</i>

388
00:31:06,920 --> 00:31:08,960
<i>Should he cross paths with you again,</i>

389
00:31:09,040 --> 00:31:11,720
<i>he will certainly leave you for dead.</i>

390
00:31:15,440 --> 00:31:17,400
<i>Therefore, this time,</i>

391
00:31:17,480 --> 00:31:19,600
<i>Chuay must step in to see to your care.</i>

392
00:31:19,680 --> 00:31:21,200
Do go on, Master.

393
00:31:21,280 --> 00:31:22,720
Pim awaits inside.

394
00:31:25,760 --> 00:31:26,600
Go on.

395
00:31:28,880 --> 00:31:30,000
<i>And you?</i>

396
00:31:30,080 --> 00:31:32,000
<i>What will you do?</i>

397
00:31:32,080 --> 00:31:34,360
<i>I shall remain in disguise at a distance,</i>

398
00:31:34,440 --> 00:31:36,560
<i>keeping a watchful eye on you,</i>

399
00:31:36,640 --> 00:31:39,240
<i>so that I may come to your aid</i>
<i>the moment you need me.</i>

400
00:31:40,440 --> 00:31:41,600
<i>Remain in disguise?</i>

401
00:31:42,440 --> 00:31:43,400
<i>How so?</i>

402
00:31:45,960 --> 00:31:46,840
Here, Master.

403
00:31:50,960 --> 00:31:51,800
Here you go.

404
00:31:53,720 --> 00:31:54,840
How very strange.

405
00:31:54,920 --> 00:31:59,160
All at once, you two
grew interested in mounting a play?

406
00:31:59,880 --> 00:32:02,800
I watched Choi during Songkran

407
00:32:02,880 --> 00:32:04,800
and felt inclined to have some fun myself.

408
00:32:06,040 --> 00:32:07,200
What of you, Phop?

409
00:32:08,000 --> 00:32:09,800
What ought you disguise yourself in?

410
00:32:11,160 --> 00:32:13,280
Euang, have you any Farangi attire?

411
00:32:33,960 --> 00:32:35,680
<i>You need not wear such attire.</i>

412
00:32:37,320 --> 00:32:39,960
There is one
that ought to suit you better.

413
00:32:49,040 --> 00:32:50,800
May I offer you some cloth?

414
00:32:50,880 --> 00:32:52,360
-Some cloth?
-I am not interested.

415
00:32:52,440 --> 00:32:54,360
-Cloth, sir?
-I'm sure they're lovely, yes.

416
00:32:54,440 --> 00:32:55,760
This way, sir.

417
00:32:55,840 --> 00:32:57,840
-Right this way.
-I'm certain they're lovely…

418
00:32:57,920 --> 00:32:59,360
-This way.
-Would you…

419
00:32:59,440 --> 00:33:00,480
This way…

420
00:33:00,560 --> 00:33:02,280
This way.

421
00:33:08,200 --> 00:33:10,480
<i>Who would ever suspect</i>
<i>that a lord like Phop</i>

422
00:33:10,560 --> 00:33:13,600
<i>would be strolling through</i>
<i>the market selling cloth?</i>

423
00:33:13,680 --> 00:33:16,240
<i>This proves that it is a perfect disguise.</i>

424
00:33:18,800 --> 00:33:20,200
Lovely cloth!

425
00:33:31,200 --> 00:33:32,320
Klao.

426
00:33:32,880 --> 00:33:34,520
Where might you be heading?

427
00:33:34,920 --> 00:33:35,880
Need not you know.

428
00:33:37,600 --> 00:33:39,160
Masters.

429
00:33:39,240 --> 00:33:41,560
It is best not to quarrel
in the marketplace.

430
00:33:42,360 --> 00:33:43,600
Pray, come with me instead.

431
00:33:44,240 --> 00:33:45,560
I hate effeminates like you.

432
00:33:46,440 --> 00:33:49,000
Good heavens!
I waste my time in women's attire.

433
00:33:51,880 --> 00:33:55,280
Last night,
I followed you into the woods,

434
00:33:56,320 --> 00:33:57,280
but I fell asleep.

435
00:33:57,360 --> 00:33:59,640
Then Lord Phop found you.

436
00:33:59,720 --> 00:34:02,200
This time, I shall not let you slip away.

437
00:34:02,280 --> 00:34:03,400
-Come!
-I refuse!

438
00:34:03,480 --> 00:34:04,440
-Come.
-Let me go!

439
00:34:04,520 --> 00:34:05,680
Hands off!

440
00:34:07,080 --> 00:34:09,040
Would you be interested in some cloth?

441
00:34:09,120 --> 00:34:11,639
Gorgeous fabric from Persia.

442
00:34:12,199 --> 00:34:13,199
What folly this be?

443
00:34:14,120 --> 00:34:15,920
Begone! I shall have no cloth!

444
00:34:16,000 --> 00:34:17,560
It is of the finest quality.

445
00:34:17,639 --> 00:34:19,239
Pray, take one.

446
00:34:20,920 --> 00:34:22,920
Are you a complete nitwit?

447
00:34:23,000 --> 00:34:24,760
I said I will have none of it!

448
00:34:24,840 --> 00:34:26,000
I beg of you.

449
00:34:26,080 --> 00:34:27,800
Pray, take the whole basket.

450
00:34:28,480 --> 00:34:29,880
Now, Klao! Move!

451
00:34:29,960 --> 00:34:30,880
Get it off!

452
00:34:32,000 --> 00:34:33,840
-Let me out.
-I must take my leave now.

453
00:34:33,920 --> 00:34:36,120
-They are truly marvelous.
-Release me!

454
00:34:36,760 --> 00:34:38,040
Curses!

455
00:34:39,960 --> 00:34:40,800
Out of my way!

456
00:34:44,360 --> 00:34:45,639
Truly gorgeous.

457
00:34:46,600 --> 00:34:48,239
This must be extremely expensive.

458
00:34:49,840 --> 00:34:51,760
Would you truly give me this?

459
00:34:54,000 --> 00:34:54,920
Yes.

460
00:34:57,640 --> 00:34:59,240
Do kindly tell me…

461
00:35:00,680 --> 00:35:04,040
that Cherd truly has
nothing to do with the opium trade.

462
00:35:19,120 --> 00:35:22,800
Pray… do answer me

463
00:35:22,880 --> 00:35:24,720
before the candles burn out.

464
00:35:29,440 --> 00:35:30,880
I have only seen him smoke it.

465
00:35:33,440 --> 00:35:36,400
Whether he sells it, I do not know.

466
00:35:38,000 --> 00:35:38,840
If that is so,

467
00:35:40,520 --> 00:35:42,480
why then did you avoid me?

468
00:35:46,160 --> 00:35:47,480
Now I remember.

469
00:35:48,120 --> 00:35:49,880
You once avoided me.

470
00:35:51,400 --> 00:35:53,320
We once had a quarrel at the teahouse.

471
00:35:55,520 --> 00:35:56,880
If you know nothing of it,

472
00:35:58,160 --> 00:35:59,520
why then did you avoid me?

473
00:36:01,920 --> 00:36:03,560
I have told you all that I know.

474
00:36:04,600 --> 00:36:05,960
Time is running short.

475
00:36:07,000 --> 00:36:08,720
Return and see me again tomorrow.

476
00:36:31,480 --> 00:36:32,800
I ask for more time.

477
00:36:34,640 --> 00:36:38,880
Pray, tell me that
Cherd has dealings in the opium trade.

478
00:36:52,960 --> 00:36:54,320
He might have dealt some.

479
00:36:55,440 --> 00:36:56,680
Some?

480
00:36:58,080 --> 00:36:59,320
How much?

481
00:37:01,600 --> 00:37:04,520
His trade is so vast that
he must have a meeting place

482
00:37:05,280 --> 00:37:07,000
or a hidden cache in the woods,

483
00:37:08,160 --> 00:37:09,040
does he not?

484
00:37:16,800 --> 00:37:18,000
I must take my leave.

485
00:37:19,920 --> 00:37:21,800
Should you need to remain here,

486
00:37:21,880 --> 00:37:24,480
I shall ask Pit and Puang
to take my place.

487
00:37:33,320 --> 00:37:34,960
I wish only to speak with you.

488
00:37:38,040 --> 00:37:41,440
I shall pay extra
to spend the whole night with you.

489
00:37:46,280 --> 00:37:47,120
What say you?

490
00:37:49,360 --> 00:37:51,640
Or is our friendship over in your eyes?

491
00:37:52,320 --> 00:37:54,160
I am quite at a loss.

492
00:37:55,680 --> 00:37:57,520
I must see Cherd after this.

493
00:38:11,120 --> 00:38:12,800
Is there enough liquor, Master?

494
00:38:23,440 --> 00:38:25,000
Would you like something else?

495
00:38:28,200 --> 00:38:29,880
Pray, wait a moment, Master.

496
00:38:29,960 --> 00:38:30,800
Here.

497
00:38:40,560 --> 00:38:42,080
Pit, Puang, who is that woman?

498
00:38:43,480 --> 00:38:45,480
She is as imposing as Benyakai herself.

499
00:38:47,880 --> 00:38:49,840
Have we such a lady?

500
00:38:49,920 --> 00:38:51,800
My thoughts exactly, my Lady.

501
00:38:54,040 --> 00:38:55,520
She came here with Master Klao.

502
00:38:55,600 --> 00:38:56,920
Indeed.

503
00:38:57,360 --> 00:38:59,800
Yet she makes no move
to serve or attend to anyone.

504
00:38:59,880 --> 00:39:00,840
Yes, my Lady.

505
00:39:01,440 --> 00:39:02,640
Even when guests arrived,

506
00:39:02,720 --> 00:39:04,840
she spoke to no one at all.

507
00:39:04,920 --> 00:39:06,240
It is indeed true.

508
00:39:26,760 --> 00:39:27,680
Who might you be?

509
00:39:28,680 --> 00:39:30,480
What brings you to this spot?

510
00:39:31,760 --> 00:39:32,600
Well…

511
00:39:33,400 --> 00:39:34,720
-I…
-Sopha!

512
00:39:39,080 --> 00:39:40,120
Where is Pim?

513
00:39:40,960 --> 00:39:42,160
I am to meet her.

514
00:39:43,640 --> 00:39:45,280
She is currently with a guest.

515
00:39:45,360 --> 00:39:46,280
Pray, wait a moment.

516
00:39:46,360 --> 00:39:47,680
A guest or Klao?

517
00:39:51,720 --> 00:39:55,240
I have told you
never to let him near her, have I not?

518
00:39:55,320 --> 00:39:58,360
But we cannot choose the guests
who seek our services.

519
00:39:58,440 --> 00:39:59,440
I care not.

520
00:40:01,360 --> 00:40:02,560
Good Master,

521
00:40:03,920 --> 00:40:06,360
let me be the one to serve you.

522
00:40:30,120 --> 00:40:32,600
Gorgeous and charming.

523
00:40:35,240 --> 00:40:36,080
My thanks.

524
00:40:37,560 --> 00:40:39,200
Take care of two of my men.

525
00:40:43,800 --> 00:40:45,840
I shall watch you serve them.

526
00:40:47,880 --> 00:40:49,080
But Master…

527
00:40:49,160 --> 00:40:50,040
You two.

528
00:40:51,400 --> 00:40:52,240
Move.

529
00:40:53,600 --> 00:40:54,640
Move

530
00:40:56,280 --> 00:40:57,120
Now.

531
00:40:58,360 --> 00:40:59,640
Now.

532
00:41:07,600 --> 00:41:08,440
Move.

533
00:41:11,400 --> 00:41:13,160
Fret not, Pim.

534
00:41:14,360 --> 00:41:15,800
Should they trouble you,

535
00:41:17,240 --> 00:41:18,760
I shall deal with them.

536
00:41:19,320 --> 00:41:23,720
So now, tell me that
Cherd has dealings in the trade.

537
00:41:28,880 --> 00:41:30,560
I shall pay you this much,

538
00:41:31,240 --> 00:41:32,400
but pray, tell me…

539
00:41:33,320 --> 00:41:38,160
this is also what I sought
the last night I came to you.

540
00:41:48,000 --> 00:41:49,040
What is the matter?

541
00:41:50,880 --> 00:41:52,560
Have I said something amiss?

542
00:41:55,760 --> 00:41:57,240
I am heartbroken.

543
00:41:57,320 --> 00:41:59,240
I held dear our bond as friends,

544
00:42:01,240 --> 00:42:05,080
yet in the end,
you used your wealth

545
00:42:05,920 --> 00:42:07,560
to purchase my obedience.

546
00:42:07,640 --> 00:42:09,840
I am but property to you!

547
00:42:11,600 --> 00:42:12,720
It is not so.

548
00:42:14,480 --> 00:42:16,600
That is not how I see you.

549
00:42:18,040 --> 00:42:21,520
The night you last came here,
you asked me the same question.

550
00:42:21,600 --> 00:42:24,200
I already told you I did not know.

551
00:42:25,320 --> 00:42:27,200
Cherd is dim-witted.

552
00:42:27,840 --> 00:42:31,320
He lacks the means
to be an opium trafficker.

553
00:42:34,560 --> 00:42:36,040
Then you disappeared.

554
00:42:40,320 --> 00:42:42,320
I wish no more questions from you.

555
00:42:43,840 --> 00:42:44,800
Even this alone…

556
00:42:46,000 --> 00:42:48,080
I feel utterly wretched!

557
00:43:57,720 --> 00:43:58,720
Master…

558
00:44:00,480 --> 00:44:02,000
Be calm, pray you.

559
00:44:04,080 --> 00:44:06,160
Why must you act thus, young lady?

560
00:44:06,240 --> 00:44:10,760
Why must you sing like a songbird
in the House of Pleasure?

561
00:44:13,120 --> 00:44:14,800
Perhaps you are not a lady here.

562
00:44:14,880 --> 00:44:16,080
Chaluay, let us depart!

563
00:44:24,640 --> 00:44:26,000
Let her go, Cherd!

564
00:44:27,360 --> 00:44:28,760
That is the lady I seek!

565
00:44:28,840 --> 00:44:30,840
Do you think I am that dim-witted, Klao?

566
00:44:32,960 --> 00:44:34,360
Your servant, is he not?

567
00:44:36,840 --> 00:44:38,400
Word from your manor

568
00:44:38,480 --> 00:44:41,600
says that you have changed,
as if you were a different person.

569
00:44:42,280 --> 00:44:45,560
Then why do you refuse
to stop pursuing me?

570
00:44:48,120 --> 00:44:51,320
What is it that you remember, Klao?

571
00:44:52,040 --> 00:44:53,160
Yet another quarrel?

572
00:44:53,800 --> 00:44:55,720
Cherd! Klao! Stand apart!

573
00:44:59,880 --> 00:45:01,120
Cherd!

574
00:45:03,000 --> 00:45:04,640
-Cherd!
-Yes.

575
00:45:04,720 --> 00:45:07,440
Not a day passes without your brawling.

576
00:45:07,520 --> 00:45:09,800
Do not force me to banish you forever.

577
00:45:12,280 --> 00:45:13,280
Dear Klao.

578
00:45:13,360 --> 00:45:16,200
Return to your manor
for Lord Phop may worry.

579
00:45:20,840 --> 00:45:21,840
Come, Chaluay.

580
00:45:32,160 --> 00:45:33,240
Hey!

581
00:45:33,320 --> 00:45:36,960
Must I change this from the House of
Pleasure to the House of Brawling?

582
00:45:40,320 --> 00:45:41,480
Move!

583
00:45:54,320 --> 00:45:55,160
Lord Phop?

584
00:46:09,920 --> 00:46:12,120
Good heavens! Lord Phop, Master Klao.

585
00:46:12,200 --> 00:46:13,520
Are you still entertained?

586
00:46:13,600 --> 00:46:16,400
-I nearly lost my life back there.
-I am sorry.

587
00:46:17,000 --> 00:46:18,200
Oh, my…

588
00:46:18,280 --> 00:46:20,600
What would my life be without you?

589
00:46:23,520 --> 00:46:24,640
It grows late.

590
00:46:25,200 --> 00:46:26,600
Have a rest, Chuay.

591
00:46:27,160 --> 00:46:28,480
I shall see to Dear Klao.

592
00:46:29,880 --> 00:46:30,720
Yes, my Lord.

593
00:46:52,960 --> 00:46:54,160
What did you discover?

594
00:47:00,040 --> 00:47:02,080
Well, not much.

595
00:47:02,160 --> 00:47:04,160
Pim merely said that

596
00:47:05,040 --> 00:47:08,200
Cherd lacked the means to do such things.

597
00:47:12,720 --> 00:47:14,080
Interesting indeed.

598
00:47:15,280 --> 00:47:18,120
The soldiers once seized
smugglers in Sam Khok.

599
00:47:20,280 --> 00:47:22,560
Were there not a great power
behind the scenes,

600
00:47:23,280 --> 00:47:25,440
they would not remain so silent.

601
00:47:33,600 --> 00:47:34,480
I know.

602
00:47:35,880 --> 00:47:38,120
But if we learn more about Cherd,

603
00:47:38,920 --> 00:47:41,280
we may be able to
trace it back to those behind it.

604
00:47:43,480 --> 00:47:44,320
Phop.

605
00:47:45,080 --> 00:47:48,640
Why is Cherd so afraid of Lord Harn?

606
00:47:51,000 --> 00:47:53,960
He has often caused trouble in the market

607
00:47:54,040 --> 00:47:56,400
under Lord Harn's jurisdiction.

608
00:47:57,640 --> 00:48:00,440
-He has been punished many a time.
-Do you think…

609
00:48:02,480 --> 00:48:04,720
there is something Lord Harn is aware of?

610
00:48:08,040 --> 00:48:09,840
I shall see to it.

611
00:48:18,040 --> 00:48:20,880
High Lord Soontrapinit,
father to Lord Harn,

612
00:48:20,960 --> 00:48:23,880
has punished
many bandits and opium traffickers.

613
00:48:25,760 --> 00:48:27,640
It may be that he knows certain truths.

614
00:48:38,120 --> 00:48:39,640
Why do you gaze upon me so?

615
00:48:41,560 --> 00:48:42,720
I…

616
00:48:42,800 --> 00:48:45,520
Might I have some more?

617
00:48:50,160 --> 00:48:51,680
That is enough, Klao.

618
00:48:52,320 --> 00:48:53,640
Lest the headache return.

619
00:48:55,280 --> 00:48:58,480
But you once told me that

620
00:48:58,560 --> 00:49:01,360
palm wine does not cause headaches.

621
00:49:01,440 --> 00:49:02,360
Or am I mistaken?

622
00:49:21,240 --> 00:49:24,240
Kindly pour me another, my Phop.

623
00:49:47,960 --> 00:49:49,280
One last pour,

624
00:49:52,000 --> 00:49:53,720
then to sleep.

625
00:50:17,040 --> 00:50:18,360
That is enough, Klao.

626
00:50:19,120 --> 00:50:20,800
I shall pour no more.

627
00:50:23,200 --> 00:50:24,080
No.

628
00:50:25,440 --> 00:50:28,560
I am but delighted that…

629
00:50:31,440 --> 00:50:33,880
I am no longer the only one trying.

630
00:50:41,720 --> 00:50:44,040
Klao, I wish to remain by your side…

631
00:50:46,160 --> 00:50:48,520
to support and care for you in all things.

632
00:50:51,400 --> 00:50:54,080
Pray, allow me to look after you.

633
00:51:21,960 --> 00:51:22,840
My Lady!

634
00:51:23,600 --> 00:51:24,920
This way!

635
00:51:30,960 --> 00:51:31,960
Dear me!

636
00:51:35,960 --> 00:51:38,320
One last pour before bedtime,

637
00:51:38,400 --> 00:51:39,800
so you said.

638
00:51:40,760 --> 00:51:41,760
I must go now.

639
00:51:44,600 --> 00:51:46,360
My Lady, do crouch down…

640
00:51:55,120 --> 00:51:58,520
His Excellency and High Lord
must depart in a few days.

641
00:52:00,360 --> 00:52:02,960
All that Phop utters
is that he is not ready.

642
00:52:04,720 --> 00:52:07,640
Why must he keep putting off the High Lord
concerning Lady Varna?

643
00:52:09,200 --> 00:52:10,760
Is it true, my Lady?

644
00:52:11,440 --> 00:52:14,920
Is it not because he already has
his heart set on someone else?

645
00:52:17,960 --> 00:52:20,000
Whom would he seek?

646
00:52:20,080 --> 00:52:23,760
His days are consumed by labor
and time spent with Klao.

647
00:52:27,040 --> 00:52:29,600
He seems wholly focused on
tutoring his brother

648
00:52:29,680 --> 00:52:32,360
in preparation for
the civil service examinations.

649
00:52:34,000 --> 00:52:36,320
Will he truly be granted the position?

650
00:52:36,400 --> 00:52:38,280
Never have I beheld Klao at study.

651
00:52:38,360 --> 00:52:39,920
He prefers to squander his time.

652
00:52:40,480 --> 00:52:41,880
Just the other day,

653
00:52:41,960 --> 00:52:45,440
he took your clothes
to dress up for a play, did he not?

654
00:52:46,640 --> 00:52:48,440
Indeed, you are correct.

655
00:52:48,520 --> 00:52:51,840
He even dressed himself as a woman.

656
00:52:54,880 --> 00:52:58,800
-Perhaps Klao is…
-He is…

657
00:53:00,720 --> 00:53:03,120
Cease this at once, Bud and Euang.

658
00:53:04,240 --> 00:53:06,680
I am seated right here, for heaven's sake.

659
00:53:24,440 --> 00:53:26,160
I swear upon my very life.

660
00:53:26,240 --> 00:53:29,240
Lady Bud and Lady Euang already
reported the matter to our lady.

661
00:53:32,760 --> 00:53:35,600
What will become of us, Phop?

662
00:53:36,560 --> 00:53:37,960
Other than Aunt,

663
00:53:39,120 --> 00:53:40,840
there is no one glad to see me.

664
00:53:42,560 --> 00:53:44,280
We shall continue as we are.

665
00:53:45,600 --> 00:53:48,080
Even if I must wed Lady Varna,

666
00:53:48,160 --> 00:53:49,920
I cannot cease loving you.

667
00:53:59,880 --> 00:54:03,200
Aunt Bud has been envious of you
since you arrived here,

668
00:54:04,680 --> 00:54:06,840
for my parents love and adore you

669
00:54:06,920 --> 00:54:09,960
more than Boon, her own son.

670
00:54:11,440 --> 00:54:14,840
As for Lady Euang, she has but a daughter

671
00:54:14,920 --> 00:54:19,040
who will never have the same chance
to succeed as you, Boon, or I.

672
00:54:20,040 --> 00:54:22,120
Thus, all she can do
is fawn upon Lady Bud,

673
00:54:22,200 --> 00:54:23,960
seeking her company merely to survive.

674
00:54:30,280 --> 00:54:31,480
Fret not,

675
00:54:32,680 --> 00:54:34,920
for they still
bear great respect for Mother,

676
00:54:37,480 --> 00:54:39,760
and she loves me more than anything else.

677
00:54:40,840 --> 00:54:43,480
It is certain that she
will come to love whom I love.

678
00:54:47,640 --> 00:54:50,000
I fear it will not be so simple, Phop.

679
00:54:50,080 --> 00:54:52,000
Nothing comes without effort.

680
00:54:53,240 --> 00:54:56,320
Even my parents did not come to love
one another so easily.

681
00:54:57,240 --> 00:54:58,480
You are aware of that.

682
00:55:00,040 --> 00:55:02,200
Simply speak your heart's desire,

683
00:55:03,040 --> 00:55:05,840
and I will see to it
that it comes to pass.

684
00:55:20,320 --> 00:55:21,520
My Lord!

685
00:55:26,120 --> 00:55:30,320
Your subordinate Kla reported that
an entire cart of opium has been seized.

686
00:55:46,880 --> 00:55:49,520
They got it past Sam Khok
and made their way to Thai Ko.

687
00:55:51,040 --> 00:55:52,440
The cart driver slipped away,

688
00:55:53,640 --> 00:55:55,360
but the guards are in pursuit.

689
00:55:59,720 --> 00:56:01,360
Will you set it aflame as before?

690
00:56:07,640 --> 00:56:09,160
Confiscate it for now.

691
00:56:09,240 --> 00:56:11,600
Should their associates learn of this,

692
00:56:12,680 --> 00:56:14,200
they might come to reclaim it.

693
00:56:18,160 --> 00:56:20,080
Reclaim all of it in one stroke?

694
00:56:21,160 --> 00:56:22,880
Who would dare be so audacious?

695
00:56:22,960 --> 00:56:25,720
We have seized more this time
than ever before.

696
00:56:25,800 --> 00:56:27,360
Its value is immense.

697
00:56:27,440 --> 00:56:29,160
They shall not let it slide.

698
00:56:30,400 --> 00:56:32,200
Lord Harn, there is a chance

699
00:56:32,280 --> 00:56:34,400
we may trace this back to those behind it.

700
00:56:39,800 --> 00:56:41,680
Upstairs at once.

701
00:56:43,360 --> 00:56:44,200
Now.

702
00:57:04,040 --> 00:57:05,800
Have someone keep close watch over Cherd.

703
00:57:05,880 --> 00:57:10,240
Observe his every move,
and seize him in the act.

704
00:57:10,840 --> 00:57:11,680
Yes, my lord.

705
00:57:30,200 --> 00:57:32,000
Your end is near, Cherd.

706
00:57:33,920 --> 00:57:35,880
Here it is, the finest of all.

707
00:57:47,760 --> 00:57:48,600
Master Klao!

708
00:57:52,040 --> 00:57:53,120
Master.

709
00:57:53,680 --> 00:57:56,000
Master Klao, I beg of you.

710
00:57:56,080 --> 00:57:57,760
The lord has returned to the manor.

711
00:57:57,840 --> 00:57:59,280
We should return as well.

712
00:57:59,840 --> 00:58:02,840
If Lord Phop discovers that
we have been trailing him

713
00:58:02,920 --> 00:58:06,160
and keeping watch into the night,
I shall lose my head, Master.

714
00:58:07,440 --> 00:58:08,280
No.

715
00:58:08,360 --> 00:58:10,680
I must see it with my own eyes.

716
00:58:11,360 --> 00:58:13,680
In my time, when such things occurred,

717
00:58:13,760 --> 00:58:16,160
the patrol was but powerless to act!

718
00:58:17,480 --> 00:58:18,400
Master Klao!

719
00:58:36,680 --> 00:58:37,640
Hey!

720
00:58:45,000 --> 00:58:46,480
Wake up.

721
00:59:00,240 --> 00:59:01,440
It smells of burnt beans.

722
00:59:02,560 --> 00:59:03,640
Castor beans?

723
00:59:05,360 --> 00:59:07,000
These people have been poisoned.

724
00:59:10,240 --> 00:59:13,600
Muan told me that
castor beans are extremely poisonous.

725
00:59:13,680 --> 00:59:15,040
How did you know of this?

726
00:59:20,640 --> 00:59:22,600
Because the truth remains but one.

727
00:59:24,080 --> 00:59:26,160
I am Detective Conan.

728
01:00:26,880 --> 01:00:27,880
Hey!

729
01:00:30,800 --> 01:00:31,640
Master!

730
01:01:23,880 --> 01:01:24,720
Phop!

731
01:02:16,040 --> 01:02:17,080
The bandits…

732
01:02:18,560 --> 01:02:20,640
They did not even
search through the piles.

733
01:02:22,720 --> 01:02:25,280
They could take the key
and unlock the door with ease.

734
01:02:27,400 --> 01:02:28,240
On top of that…

735
01:02:29,480 --> 01:02:32,240
they could drug the guards

736
01:02:32,320 --> 01:02:34,960
without them ever noticing.

737
01:02:40,600 --> 01:02:41,560
Phop.

738
01:02:42,560 --> 01:02:43,520
I believe that…

739
01:02:45,000 --> 01:02:46,440
the culprit…

740
01:02:48,440 --> 01:02:52,120
is likely from your own
Patrol Department.

741
01:02:59,840 --> 01:03:00,680
Is that so?

742
01:03:19,320 --> 01:03:20,160
Phop.

743
01:03:23,560 --> 01:03:25,400
The one whose arm you cut…

744
01:03:27,040 --> 01:03:30,000
his cry was similar to Cherd's.

745
01:03:37,120 --> 01:03:38,720
It is unlikely to be him.

746
01:03:39,600 --> 01:03:42,360
I had my subordinate Kla watch over him.

747
01:03:43,600 --> 01:03:45,040
He reported that…

748
01:03:47,000 --> 01:03:51,360
Cherd had been
at Thong's tavern since dusk.

749
01:03:51,440 --> 01:03:53,800
Only when it was over
did he return to his manor.

750
01:04:02,680 --> 01:04:05,160
You may scold or chastise me as you will.

751
01:04:21,120 --> 01:04:23,080
Your heart already is heavy with guilt.

752
01:04:24,920 --> 01:04:27,160
To scold you further
would only cause more pain.

753
01:05:12,000 --> 01:05:14,560
I am more than relieved
that you made it out alive.

754
01:05:18,040 --> 01:05:19,200
I beg you, listen to me.

755
01:05:20,680 --> 01:05:22,000
This is not an order,

756
01:05:23,680 --> 01:05:24,880
but a humble plea.

757
01:05:27,160 --> 01:05:29,200
Whatever you do,

758
01:05:29,280 --> 01:05:30,600
or wherever you go,

759
01:05:32,560 --> 01:05:34,800
keep me in your heart
a little more than before.

760
01:05:36,840 --> 01:05:38,640
Should any harm befall you,

761
01:05:40,680 --> 01:05:43,280
I would surely perish
of a broken heart thereafter.

762
01:05:49,200 --> 01:05:50,320
I apologize.

763
01:05:52,240 --> 01:05:53,440
From now on,

764
01:05:53,520 --> 01:05:57,640
even when I go to the privy,
I shall let you know.

765
01:05:59,760 --> 01:06:00,600
Pray…

766
01:06:01,320 --> 01:06:02,640
cease being upset with me.

767
01:06:08,400 --> 01:06:09,440
Why this laughter?

768
01:06:10,360 --> 01:06:11,560
I am serious.

769
01:06:13,720 --> 01:06:14,560
Cute.

770
01:06:16,120 --> 01:06:17,920
A stubborn soul such as yours,

771
01:06:18,840 --> 01:06:23,520
yet acting so sweet and clingy
is truly charming.

772
01:06:28,440 --> 01:06:29,360
I…

773
01:06:29,440 --> 01:06:30,960
I am truly sad.

774
01:06:34,200 --> 01:06:37,760
You no longer are, it seems,
for you can now smile.

775
01:06:59,360 --> 01:07:00,200
Klao…

776
01:07:04,840 --> 01:07:07,880
I know that many hardships lie before us,

777
01:07:11,080 --> 01:07:12,760
yet I promise…

778
01:07:14,000 --> 01:07:16,000
to protect you with all my might.

779
01:07:27,720 --> 01:07:33,480
Let me care for you
until my very last breath.

780
01:07:37,080 --> 01:07:39,440
Could you find it in your heart
to accept my love?

781
01:07:59,520 --> 01:08:00,880
Have I made myself clear?

782
01:09:46,520 --> 01:09:48,040
If you do not stop me now,

783
01:09:50,840 --> 01:09:52,920
I shall follow my heart's desire.

784
01:09:54,840 --> 01:09:56,480
Why should I stop you,

785
01:09:59,560 --> 01:10:01,800
when I too am following my heart's desire?

786
01:11:34,600 --> 01:11:35,800
Fret not,

787
01:11:37,120 --> 01:11:39,480
for I shall treat you
with the utmost tenderness.

788
01:12:13,640 --> 01:12:15,480
Is it pleasant to you?

789
01:13:43,560 --> 01:13:45,160
I love you dearly.

790
01:13:57,680 --> 01:13:59,840
I also love you dearly, all right?

791
01:14:01,280 --> 01:14:02,120
All right.

792
01:14:27,440 --> 01:14:29,920
I have prepared this meal for you today.

793
01:14:30,000 --> 01:14:32,640
-Do you often bring me meals?
-No, Master.

794
01:14:32,720 --> 01:14:34,680
He usually prepares it for the physician.

795
01:14:34,760 --> 01:14:37,960
Buaphan! Have I not told you
to speak of him no more?

796
01:14:40,600 --> 01:14:44,240
While I am away,
keep close watch over the servants.

797
01:14:44,320 --> 01:14:45,440
Yes, my lady.

798
01:14:45,520 --> 01:14:48,800
<i>I shall keep watch</i>
<i>to ensure nothing disgraceful occurs.</i>

799
01:14:49,360 --> 01:14:52,760
I… I promise that
it shall never happen again.

